  "hardware": {
    "family": "Linux NVIDIA CUDA",
    "testedMachine": "DGX Spark / GB10 class NVIDIA system",
    "notes": [
      "One generation at a time per runtime. SFT runs 50 steps at guidance 7.0; Turbo is guidance-distilled, so the pipeline detects it and coerces guidance to 1.0 over 8 steps.",
      "Diffusers implements the adaptive projected guidance ACE-Step base/SFT expect. ComfyUI's KSampler applies vanilla CFG instead, which garbles these checkpoints above roughly 2.5 guidance (Comfy-Org/ComfyUI#12322), so this backend is the supported path for SFT.",
      "bpm, keyscale and timesignature default to unset, letting the checkpoint infer them from the prompt rather than pinning 100 BPM in C major.",
      "Cold model loading is separate from inference and can take a minute or more."
    ]
  },
